    "pve": {
      "en": "Hex Spell. Target foe and all nearby foes are hexed with Mark of Rodgort. For 10...30...35 seconds, whenever each foe is struck for fire damage, that foe is set on fire for 1...3...4 second[s].",
      "zhTW": "使目標及其附近所有敵人遭受此「降咒」。持續 10～35 秒，每當這些敵人受到火焰傷害時遭受「著火」病症 1～4 秒。"
    },
